Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:12.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}In a season of dreams,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在这个梦幻般的赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:17.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalinska comes through, emerging battle-hardened{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡历经苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:19.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to defeat Maria Sakkari{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N击败萨卡里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:22.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to reach her third career WTA semifinal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N生涯第三次跻身巡回赛四强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:27.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}As Iga Swiatek rolls through in straight sets,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克直落两盘过关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:29.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}six-four, six-one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:31.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and will face fellow Pole Maja Chwalinska in the semifinals.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N半决赛将对阵同胞赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jesteśmy mistrzami Europy!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们是欧洲冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:37.18,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}12{\fs68}年前 她们第一次隔网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}年前 她们站上同一个领奖台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:43.17,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 只有一个人能走进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:46.00,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}17{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:47.45,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:49.21,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克对月亮姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:50.43,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:52.85,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次由两个波兰人来打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:59.43,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐说 感觉自己认识她一辈子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:01.83,TL,,0,0,0,,因为她们是一起开始打比赛的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:09.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalińska, mam 14 lat,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我是玛雅 赫瓦林斯卡 {\fs78}14{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}mieszkam w Dąbrowie Górniczej{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N住在达布罗瓦古尔尼恰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:17.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}i trenuję od 7 roku życia.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}7{\fs68}岁开始练球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:20.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nazywam się Iga Świątek, mam 14 lat,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我叫伊加 斯瓦泰克 {\fs78}14{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:21.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}trenuję w Warszawskim Klubie Tenisowym Mera,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在华沙梅拉网球俱乐部训练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}trenuje mnie Michał Kaznowski i gram od 8 lat.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N教练是卡兹诺夫斯基 打球{\fs78}8{\fs68}年了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:25.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jesteśmy zgrane.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们很合得来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ja z Mają już byłam na kilku drużynówkach,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我和玛雅打过好几次团体赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.53,0:01:29.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}dobrze się znamy,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很了解彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:30.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}zagadujemy się.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N总有聊不完的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:35.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Czasami oczywiście są jakieś sprzeczki,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当然 有时也会拌嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:37.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}ale potrafimy szybko to rozwiązać.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我们很快就能和好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nie gram tak jakoś siłowo jak większość dziewczyn,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不像大多数女孩那样靠力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:43.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}więc gram bardziej tak wszechstronnie,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以打得更全面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.11,0:01:46.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}dużo slice'ów, zmianę rotacji, to jest taka moja gra.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N切削 变旋转 这就是我的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:51.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I myślę, że w większości meczów to jest kluczem,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我觉得很多比赛里 关键在于
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:57.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}że wygrywam na przykład mecze dzięki temu, że lepiej gram właśnie w takich kluczowych momentach:{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我能在关键分上打得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:02:01.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}slice'y, różne takie zmiany rytmu, a nie tylko bum-bum.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N切削和节奏变化 不只是砰砰砰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:02.45,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:04.42,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下了欧洲青少年锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:07.50,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}14{\fs68}岁组和{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁组的双打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年青少年联合会杯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:12.72,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下最后一分 她们抱在了一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:18.45,TL,,0,0,0,,那年秋天在斯德哥尔摩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:19.78,TL,,0,0,0,,两个{\fs78}15{\fs68}岁的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:21.40,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次在职业赛里交手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:22.95,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:25.17,TL,,0,0,0,,几个月后的澳网 两个人搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.17,0:02:28.28,TL,,0,0,0,,打进青少年女双决赛 拿了亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:34.78,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 两个人走上了完全不同的路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年 {\fs78}19{\fs68}岁的斯瓦泰克拿下法网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:42.25,TL,,0,0,0,,波兰第一个大满贯单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:44.80,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 她当上了世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:49.75,TL,,0,0,0,,同一时间 月亮姐却撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:52.35,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年 {\fs78}19{\fs68}岁的她因为抑郁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:54.44,TL,,0,0,0,,暂停了职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:02:58.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, I needed to take a break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我需要停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:04.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And I honestly didn't know if I'm gonna come back or not, to be like honest with you.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说实话 我不知道还会不会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.51,0:03:07.70,TL,,0,0,0,,一年后 她回到了赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:08.49,TL,,0,0,0,,这些年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:10.93,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人也一直是国家队的队友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.93,0:03:12.26,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年联合杯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.26,0:03:13.39,TL,,0,0,0,,她们都在波兰队
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.21,TL,,0,0,0,,一起打进了决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:20.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think it's the third year in a row we're making semis or better.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们连续三年打进四强以上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:24.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So two years ago it was semis, last year it was a final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N前年是四强 去年是决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:26.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So you guys answer the question, what's coming tomorrow.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N明天会怎样 你们来回答吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:30.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Team Poland into the finals. Well done, congratulations!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N波兰队打进决赛 恭喜！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:32.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年春天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.94,TL,,0,0,0,,轮到月亮姐往上走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:38.24,TL,,0,0,0,,世界第{\fs78}114{\fs68}的她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:40.18,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛赢下施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.18,0:03:41.94,TL,,0,0,0,,她成了法网历史上第一个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:44.53,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛打进决赛的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.41,0:03:52.75,TL,,0,0,0,,这个星期在武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:54.96,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘赢了萨卡里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:56.40,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘前{\fs78}11{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:58.08,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人都保住了发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:04:00.18,TL,,0,0,0,,第{\fs78}12{\fs68}局她破发拿下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:02.53,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次打进{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛四强 下周一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:05.05,TL,,0,0,0,,她还会第一次进入世界前{\fs78}20{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:16.65,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克也是两盘过关
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:18.25,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}个发球局一个没丢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:20.28,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点全部化解
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:22.13,TL,,0,0,0,,这样一来 {\fs78}10{\fs68}站{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:24.65,TL,,0,0,0,,她每一站都打进过半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:35.24,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后她说 两个波兰人都进了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:37.22,TL,,0,0,0,,对波兰网球意义很大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:38.75,TL,,0,0,0,,她真为月亮姐高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:41.26,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年月亮姐进步了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:42.85,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}年前在斯德哥尔摩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:44.13,TL,,0,0,0,,赢的是斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:44.75,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:47.44,TL,,0,0,0,,是她们第一次在巡回赛上相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:50.26,TL,,0,0,0,,这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.92,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克要冲击她第一个武汉决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:55.08,TL,,0,0,0,,赢了 {\fs78}10{\fs68}站{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:56.78,TL,,0,0,0,,她就全都打进过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:04:58.00,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐要冲击的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.12,TL,,0,0,0,,是生涯第一个{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:02.92,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}2014{\fs68}年第一次在少年比赛里交手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:05.04,TL,,0,0,0,,到今天在{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛半决赛碰面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:06.99,TL,,0,0,0,,已经过去了{\fs78}12{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:22.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What an effort by the Pole.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N波兰姑娘拼尽了全力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.37,0:05:25.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A dominant opening set, score-wise;{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘比分一边倒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:27.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}she had to outlast the Greek in the end.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后还是得熬过这位希腊对手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:33.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And when it seemed the experience of Sakkari{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当萨卡里的经验似乎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:35.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}might prevail in the end,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就要占上风时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja says, “No, no, not this year,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N玛雅说 不 今年不行
